  "notes": "Map labels (docs/tasks/geo/osm-rendering-design.md, labels): Country Places of Poland written into TEST_PROFILES (Route > Generate Country Places) and shown by Map > Markers, from the whole country to a town; upright in a turned view; over OSM data (needs --set core.paths.osmData=<converted Poland files>).",
